          {
            "title": "Example: Braces",
            "id": 74527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mark out the code that belongs to these functions.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code> followed by <code>}</code> and then <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the function definitions so the supplied call prints <code>Brightness up</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>increaseBrightness</code>, followed by <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>{</code>, and finally <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function",
            "id": 74492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we create functions?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To group and reuse related code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To separate related code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">To make it easier to create variables</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To group and reuse related code.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Three buttons must each show the same confirmation message. What is the best reason to put that message in a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code can be grouped once and called whenever it is needed.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Defining the function makes the message appear automatically.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Each button gets a separate copy of the message code.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code can be grouped once and called whenever it is needed.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 74488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we call a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code inside the function runs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">All the code inside the function is stored in a variable</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A while loop is created inside the function</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code inside the function runs.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>showMenu</code> contains three <code>console.log</code> statements. What happens when the program runs <code>showMenu()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Those three statements run at that point in the program.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The statements are stored in a new variable.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">JavaScript creates a loop around the statements.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Those three statements run at that point in the program.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 74483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finish calling the function by coding its name.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot; Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(money + currency);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"118\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>displayCash</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 74532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code> on one line and <code>Days a year</code> on the next</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code> on one line and <code>Days a year</code> on the next.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When <code>daysAYear()</code> runs before the following log, which value reaches the console first?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code>, because <code>daysAYear()</code> runs before the next log.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code>, because it is outside the function.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Both values appear on the same line.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code>, because <code>daysAYear()</code> runs before the next log.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the parameter in this function?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There is no parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the program calls <code>addUser(\"Mina\")</code>, which name receives <code>\"Mina\"</code> inside the copied function?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No name receives it because the function has no parameter.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the function and pass it a value.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>removeUser</code>, followed by <code>\"Lisa\"</code>, and finally <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete <code>removeUser</code>, then call it with <code>\"Lisa\"</code> so the console reports her removal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>user</code>, followed by <code>removeUser</code>, <code>\"Lisa\"</code>, and finally <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are parameters for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parameters help us pass specific information to functions</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parameters make it easier to call functions</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parameters allow us to display variables in the console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parameters help us pass specific information to functions.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A <code>greet</code> function should display a different name each time it is called. What should it use for that changing name?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A parameter such as name.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A fixed name string inside the function.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The same name string in every function call.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A parameter such as name.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a parameter to the function and then call it with a value.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>temp</code>, followed by <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the function and pass it the number <code>60</code>, so it prints <code>Current temp:</code> followed by that number.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;60&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>temperatureUpdate</code>, followed by <code>temp</code>, and finally <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing a value ",
            "id": 74648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finish calling the function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"totalWeight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" measurement = \" /><text value=\"&quot; grams&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + measurement);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"totalWeight(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"111\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"250 grams\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>totalWeight</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Using the return value",
            "id": 74685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we add a return value to a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The function returns a value to the code that calls it</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The function can no longer use display statements</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It means we'll only be able to call the function once</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The function returns a value to the code that calls it.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const total = addTen(20)</code> calls a function that returns <code>30</code>. What is stored in <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The function itself.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>30</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No return statement",
            "id": 74687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we end up returning <code>undefined</code> from our function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By forgetting to add the <code>return</code> statement</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By not including any display statements in our code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By calling the function with a parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By forgetting to add the <code>return</code> statement.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const answer = showAnswer()</code> calls a function that only logs text and has no <code>return</code>. What is stored in <code>answer</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The text that was logged.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The function name as a string.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 74698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>result</code> variable and store the result of calling the function with a value inside it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const</code> followed by <code>result</code> and then <code>moreThanTen</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store <code>moreThanTen(14)</code> in the constant <code>result</code>, then print the Boolean result.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>number</code>, followed by <code>const</code>, <code>result</code>, <code>moreThanTen</code>, and finally <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 74688,
